  "description": "Lee Yewon, a dog beastkin, is suddenly kicked out of his college dorm and has nowhere to go despite his approaching rut cycle. That's when cat beastkin and classmate Ji Seunghoo comes to the rescue. Seunghoo lets Yewon stay at his house for as long as he needs. But while this feline might seem like a savior at first, it's really just his scheme to eat up the canine he's been crushing on for the longest time!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
